        "slc_5de92ae9c4b3619b9662f97d0f680b37c6612e829cedf6b1f337a5e489c08f48"
      ],
      "text": "Agent-Blackbox is described as a local-first flight recorder and context-efficiency profiler for coding agents, rebuilding each run as a live, replayable operational graph from observed events rather than the agent's own summary."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e39737b91b6e09ba70fe7c58c1a642d25d0bced4601545e00e4799ab2fb39a19",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "bc0d72aeb7bd207b48099ba07f813be37c0e449c",
          "git_sha": "11191d87cd7af63bc0d5c75eeeb4999cfec532e1",
          "line_end": 398,
          "line_start": 387,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "taewooopark/agent-blackbox",
          "url": "https://github.com/TaewoooPark/Agent-Blackbox/blob/bc0d72aeb7bd207b48099ba07f813be37c0e449c/README.md#L387-L398"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_482447a939ef624ba367fc9a89c87801657c863e0c470de13f3122bfd3103b93"
      ],
      "text": "The daemon exposes an HTTP/WebSocket API including POST /events, GET /graph?seq, GET /snapshot, GET /audit, GET /efficiency, POST /suggest, GET/POST /optimize[/apply|/revert], GET /handoff, and WS /stream for live snapshots."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b5f198f73dc0088679c14b48dd4f4ebfa98971f00ea5553189d2d0e128094d29",
