      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_54ec1f60a96784d8288131bb8965b1231f6a6f08db90fd1cbbe7685482517ba5"
      ],
      "text": "Per-project state lives under <project>/.agent-blackbox/ (optimization.json, efficiency-profile.json, optional rules.json), with cross-run baselines stored as baselines.json next to the daemon's event store."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
